# Test mode recipe

This is a gameplay validation recipe to prove the mod played, not just started.

## Preconditions
- Start the game in a PEAK session with the mod enabled.
- Confirm a local Scribblenauts install is available and accessible at runtime.
- Confirm the player spawns on PEAK's beach in the first minute.

## Required checks
1. Open the notepad UI keybind within 60 seconds of spawn.
2. Enter `rope`.
3. Confirm a PEAK object matching `PeakRope` appears in the player's hand.
4. Confirm stamina cost is applied to the local player's stamina value.
5. Record a screenshot with the object in hand.
6. In multiplayer mode, test host plus join with two game instances, each using their own item spawn logic.

## Success criteria
- A real object is spawned by text input.
- The item appears in the player's hands.
- The stamina value decreases by the configured cost.
- The screenshot file exists and captures in-game proof of the conjure.
- Multiplayer host/join is validated only when the environment supports it.
